r package review behavior. Self-review passes confirmed the in-scope story, tech-design, and test-plan obligations are implemented and evidenced, with remaining deferred cleanup explicitly surfaced below.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"changedFiles\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/readers/materials-section.reader.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Derives current-material artifact role labels from version provenance so process-local visibility no longer depends on legacy artifact ownership hints.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Builds review target availability from current refs plus existing produced-artifact visibility, preserving prior behavior while enabling cross-process referenced artifacts.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"apps/platform/server/services/review/artifact-review.service.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Allows direct artifact review when the process currently references the artifact, while retaining produced-artifact review access.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Adds API coverage that project-shell artifact summaries exclude legacy process ownership fields.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Adds process-surface coverage for referenced-artifact materials labeling and review availability from current refs.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Adds review-route coverage for a later process reviewing an artifact produced by an earlier process.\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\"tests\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"added\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"modified\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"tests/